        {
          "text": "一包行情写了什么，双路收到的两份是不是同一条消息，一笔订单怎样从请求走到成交。",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "AUTO",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "MANUAL",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "pcap",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "“真实流量”指实验室网线上的实包。",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "认出真实行情 → 比较行情交付 → 追踪订单状态",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "Add Order（新增订单，类型 A）",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "Feed Handler（行情处理逻辑）",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "载荷（payload）",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "偏移（offset）",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "宽度",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "大端（big-endian）",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "ASCII",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "Type、Stock Locate、Stock",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "网页五档是这些订单按价格聚合的结果，不是五种消息类型；P 不改变展示簿。",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "duplicate（重复）",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "pending（等待前序的消息）",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "gap（缺口）",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "理论落到实验：",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "保存哪些包",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "Packet Details（报文详情）",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "captured",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "dropped by kernel",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "received by filter",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "不是消息的字节长度",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "Unix Socket（同机进程通信通道）",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "发送模式",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "去重",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "理论落到实验：",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "各抓 120 包，总计三份 pcap",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "分帧（framing）",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "U（Unsequenced Data，未编号业务数据）",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "S（Sequenced Data，按会话顺序编号的业务数据）",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "必须先认协议层，再读字母。",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "client_order_id（客户端编号）",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "UserRefNum",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "本课不能用两边同名的号把一笔模拟成交硬对到历史成交。",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "OUCH 占 8 字节，ITCH A 的 Price 占 4 字节",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "48/65/37",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "理论落到实验：",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "连接有没有混？",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "是不是同一笔？",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "是否真的成交？",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "清理与恢复：",
          "weight": "700"
        },
        {
          "text": "验证范围：",
